# Build context for docsgpt/Dockerfile is the repository root, so the `ui`
# stage can build the web UI. Allow only what the image needs; everything else
# (docs, tests, venvs, a checkout's application/ data) stays out.
*
!docsgpt/
# The web UI's source and the script that builds it (the `ui` stage).
!frontend/
!scripts/build_frontend.sh
# The ClusterFuzzLite image (.clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile) builds from the root
# as well and needs its harnesses; the docsgpt image never copies these.
!.clusterfuzzlite/
!tests/fuzz/

# Inside the package: caches, local runtime data and secrets never ship.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
docsgpt/.pytest_cache/
docsgpt/.ruff_cache/
docsgpt/.coverage
docsgpt/htmlcov/
docsgpt/*.log
docsgpt/indexes/
docsgpt/inputs/
docsgpt/vectors/
docsgpt/*.faiss
docsgpt/*.pkl
docsgpt/.env
docsgpt/.env.*
docsgpt/Dockerfile
# A local UI build stays out: the `ui` stage builds the one the image serves.
docsgpt/static/

# Inside the frontend: installed packages and local builds are redone in the
# `ui` stage, and local VITE_* overrides must not be baked into a published image.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.env.local
frontend/.env.*.local
frontend/*.log
# The frontend image's own build files; changing them must not rebuild this UI.
frontend/Dockerfile
frontend/.dockerignore
frontend/docker/
